fields.value:
 * Has the following ability targeting functionalities:
** {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Aura}}
*** [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-9-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-9-2.png|84px]]
**** Can affect allied units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Magnetic Field cast range}}+{{#var:Magnetic Field value1}}}}-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]]. 
**** Creates an [[aura]] centered around the {{Symbol|Target|Area}} area-targeted location [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] upon cast.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** {{M|Portrait-casting}} or {{M|doubletap}} creates the aura centered around The Self or the {{M|The Double}}.

* {{Symbol|Target|Area-inter}}
** Multiple overlapping Magnetic Field radius do not stack and works independently.
** Despite its visual effects, the effective area-of-effect is a [[File:Dota2 Area Cylinder icon.png|20px|Area-of-effect visualized.]] [[Wikipedia:Cylinder|cylinder]] and not a sphere.
** Does not affect the following units:
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
** Grants the following ability effects to allied heroes and creeps within the {{M|aura}} radius:
*** {{Symbol|Attack Speed}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|arc_warden_magnetic_field_attack_speed}}
**** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||attack speed increasing|15tal}} {{M|talent|t=t2l}} immediately updates the current instances.
***** However, it does not update the currently applied buff to affected allied units.
*** {{Symbol|Evasion}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|arc_warden_magnetic_field_evasion}}
**** Absolute [[evasion]] to incoming attacks from outside the Magnetic Field.
**** {{Symbol|Target|Area-inter}}
***** Hence, when an allied unit is within the intersection of both Magnetic Fields, it has absolute [[evasion]] from incoming attacks from outside the radius, unless the attacking source is within the intersection.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Magnetic Field icon0}}
| desc = Arc Warden generates a circular distortion field of magnetic energy. The Magnetic Field grants bonus attack speed and protects allied units within it by evading attacks coming from outside the field. The Magnetic Field pulls runes, and runes inside Magnetic Field automatically activate.
}}

