*** Grants a non-lingering {{#var:Spark Wraith basic2}}-radius [[vision]] centered around the wraith for while idling.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** Has the following activation sequence:
***# {{Symbol|a|Counter}}
***#* Has a {{#var:Spark Wraith value2}}-second activation delay duration.
