***#* {{Symbol|Vision|Base}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***#** Grants a non-lingering {{#var:Spark Wraith basic2}}-radius vision while traveling to the enemy unit.
*** {{Symbol|a|Counter}}
**** The activation delay component is independent of the idle duration.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*** Grants a 3.34-second {{#var:Spark Wraith basic2}}-radius vision upon projectile impact.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|spark_wraith_purge}}
**#* This ability component applies the {{M|movement speed}} slow.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Invisible}} units.
*** {{M|Fogged units}}.
